(7782009, 1294932, 12200, '<td valign="top">
This is a lovely photo and a striking composition. I''m not sure I would call it "foreground interest," though. To me, the horizon registers much more immediately as the compelling focal point. Which is not a criticism of the photo--only an explanation for why it''s a teensy bit lower for me than some others in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo and a striking composition. I''m not sure I would call it "foreground interest," though. To me, the horizon registers much more immediately as the compelling focal point. Which is not a criticism of the photo--only an explanation for why it''s a teensy bit lower for me than some others in this challenge.', '2025-05-28 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7782010, 1294950, 12200, '<td valign="top">
