I really like this.  It has a dream-like quality, with the heads pooping up amongst the reeds and fluff.  Well done.  Dof is great, although it is so thin that some of the geese (?) look a bit soft.</td>', 'I really like this.  It has a dream-like quality, with the heads pooping up amongst the reeds and fluff.  Well done.  Dof is great, although it is so thin that some of the geese (?) look a bit soft.', '2025-05-31 15:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7782172, 1294698, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Love this photo. It''s definitely effective as a study in foreground interest, and the level of detail and color balance is incredible. My one reservation has to do with the way the bird registers in "uncanny valley" territory--as if it had been dropped in from another place where the lighting is different from the rest of this composition. I''m assuming that was an artistic choice. Still weighing its effectiveness for me. Will return to vote later. :-)</td>', 'Love this photo. It''s definitely effective as a study in foreground interest, and the level of detail and color balance is incredible. My one reservation has to do with the way the bird registers in "uncanny valley" territory--as if it had been dropped in from another place where the lighting is different from the rest of this composition. I''m assuming that was an artistic choice. Still weighing its effectiveness for me. Will return to vote later. :-)', '2025-06-01 00:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
